-# A Devise page laid out the way the sign in and sign up dialogs are: a header
-# with the title, the form in the body, and the links to the other Devise pages
-# in the footer. Locals: title, and a block for the body; `links: false` leaves
-# the footer out (for someone already signed in).
.form-page
  .modal-content.form-card
    .modal-header
      %h1.modal-title.h5= title
    .modal-body
      = yield
    - if local_assigns.fetch(:links, true)
      .modal-footer.d-block
        = render 'devise/shared/links'
